<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese bond/Bund spreads could narrow - official.</title>
<headline>Portuguese bond/Bund spreads could narrow - official.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yield spreads between Portuguese government bonds and German Bunds could narrow with growing expectations that Portugal will join Economic and Monetary Union (EMU) from the start, a senior Portuguese official told Reuters.</p>
</text>
